# 🎓 COEP Tech | Department of Electronics & Telecommunication

Welcome to the official repository hub for the **ENTC Department**. This space serves as a central archive for research projects, lab experiments, and collaborative course materials.

---

## 🏛️ Department Overview
The Department of Electronics & Telecommunication at COEP, established in 1948, is one of the oldest and most prestigious in India. We focus on cutting-edge research in Signal Processing, VLSI, Embedded Systems, and Communication Networks.

### 🧪 Research Labs
* **VLSI & Embedded Systems Lab**
* **Digital Signal Processing (DSP) Lab**
* **Optical Communication Lab**
* **Robotics & AI Center**

